## 2. Free Use

The Official Version of the OpenOBC mobile application is provided for free use by end users.

Subject to this License, users may:

- install the Official Version;
- use the application without purchasing a license;
- use the application for personal purposes;
- use the application for educational and research purposes;
- use the application with compatible OpenOBC hardware;
- use the application for vehicle diagnostics, development, testing, and engineering; and
- create reasonable backup copies of the Official Version for their own use.

No payment is required solely to obtain a license to use the basic Official Version.

"Free use" refers to the absence of a mandatory license fee for use of the application and does not mean that the Software is open source or that its source code is freely available.

